  "doc": {
    "description": "13 -- RegisterN: an N-bit load-enable register from D latches.\n\nA generator instantiates user-defined sequential components in bulk\nexactly as it does primitives.  While LD is high the register tracks\nD; when LD drops it holds the last value.  The inverted outputs of\nthe latches are simply left unused -- instance outputs need no\nconsumers (§6.4: fan-out, including zero, is free).",
    "source": "circuit.shdl",
